type variable bounded by dtype family `Float` (the active float dtypes) cannot be instantiated at `int64`

Nautilus.Roots.brent, bisection and newton are declared `[prec: Float]`
(nautilus#67). An int64 objective is outside that family, so the call is a
compile-time PrecisionMismatch naming the family and the offending type
([04-DTYPE-2]) rather than a truncated integer root.
